WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.080
Beautifying the mitzvah has defined financial rules.

00:00:03.380 --> 00:00:06.140
Make preparation appealing within a responsible budget.

00:00:06.780 --> 00:00:10.000
Attractiveness supports effort without turning every enhancement

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:11.800
into an unlimited obligation.
